@page "/counter"


<h1>Counter</h1>
@*The singleton and the transient dependencies were declareted on the Program.cs
By the way, everytime that the component is accessed a the transient dependency is 
laoded, but the singleton dependency is the same!*@
<p>Current count: @currentCount</p>
<p>Singleton count: @singleton.Value</p>
<p>Transient count: @transient.Value</p>

<button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="IncrementCount">
    Click me
</button>

